WEBVTT

00:13:28.546 --> 00:13:32.449
Sportisti poput španskog dugoprugaša,
Kiliana Džornea.

00:13:32.449 --> 00:13:34.449
Ovde Kilian trči uz Materhorn.

00:13:34.449 --> 00:13:35.961
(Smeh)

00:13:35.961 --> 00:13:38.037
Vezao je duks oko struka.

00:13:38.037 --> 00:13:40.292
Toliko je strmo da se ni ne može trčati.

00:13:40.292 --> 00:13:41.945
Penje se konopcem.

00:13:41.945 --> 00:13:43.282
U pitanju je uspon

00:13:43.282 --> 00:13:45.391
od više nego 2.400 metara,

00:13:45.391 --> 00:13:47.058
a Kilian se popeo i spustio

00:13:47.058 --> 00:13:49.439
za manje od tri sata.

00:13:49.439 --> 00:13:51.358
Neverovatno.

00:13:51.358 --> 00:13:52.547
I iako je talentovan,

00:13:52.547 --> 00:13:55.371
Kilian ipak nije medicinski fenomen.

00:13:55.371 --> 00:13:57.050
Kad je on ovo uspeo,

00:13:57.050 --> 00:13:58.961
i drugi će pokušati,

00:13:58.961 --> 00:14:00.478
kao što su pokušali